    "turn_text": "we're really excited about this happening. So a lot of people have, you know, just a lot of confusion as it relates to the upcoming election. We actually debated this on the show as to whether or not or what the circumstances would be that an election wouldn't take place this year? Can you enlighten the audience as to what circumstances an election wouldn't take place?",
